{% comment %}
  トップページ用「おすすめ注目ブランド特集」ティザーセクション（新規・2026-09-07、
  D:\Inetpub\shopify_data\stitch\top\ のデザイン案対応）。

  データソースは sections/feature-list.liquid（/pages/feature-list の全件表示用）と同じ、
  handleが'feature-'で始まるCustom Collection（データ系が現行サイトの特集ページを移行済み、
  2026-08-26時点で30件）。デザイン案では「Brand No.494」「LONG SELLER」「HOT PICK」等の
  個別バッジが付与されているが、これらは特集コレクション側に対応するデータが存在しない
  （merchandising判断のタグ付けであり機械的に算出できない）ため、実データに無い文言は追加せず、
  共通の「PICKUP」ラベルのみを付与している。

  featureセクションと同じくcollectionsは最大250件までしかpaginateできないが、本ティザーは
  先頭3件のみを表示すれば十分なため、1ページ目（デフォルトlimit）の範囲で完結し、
  feature-list.liquidのようなJS追加取得は不要。
{% endcomment %}
{% liquid
  assign max_items = 3
%}

<div class="section-background color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"></div>
<div class="home-feature-spotlight color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} page-width-normal">
  <div class="home-feature-spotlight__header">
    <p class="home-feature-spotlight__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | default: 'CURATED LABELS' }}</p>
    <h2 class="home-feature-spotlight__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'おすすめ注目ブランド特集' }}</h2>
    <a href="/pages/feature-list" class="home-feature-spotlight__more">
      すべての特集を見る
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="home-feature-spotlight__grid">
    {% assign shown = 0 %}
    {%- comment -%}
      collectionsオブジェクトは{% paginate %}無しだと先頭50件しか参照できず、かつ
      デフォルトの並び順は保証されない。特集コレクション（30件）がブランド/カテゴリ/お悩み
      コレクション（合計750件超）の中に埋もれて先頭50件に入らない可能性があるため、
      sections/feature-list.liquidと同じくpaginate by 250で確実に全特集を走査範囲に含める。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {% paginate collections by 250 %}
      {% for collection in collections %}
        {% assign handle_prefix = collection.handle | slice: 0, 8 %}
        {% if handle_prefix == 'feature-' and shown < max_items %}
        {% assign feature_desc = collection.description | strip_html | truncate: 90 %}
        <a href="{{ collection.url }}" class="home-feature-spotlight__card">
          <span class="home-feature-spotlight__image">
            {% if collection.image %}
              <img
                class="home-feature-spotlight__image-img"
                src="{{ collection.image | image_url: width: 480 }}"
                srcset="
                  {{ collection.image | image_url: width: 320 }} 320w,
                  {{ collection.image | image_url: width: 480 }} 480w,
                  {{ collection.image | image_url: width: 640 }} 640w
                "
                sizes="(min-width: 750px) 33vw, 90vw"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ collection.image.width }}"
                height="{{ collection.image.height }}"
                alt="{{ collection.image.alt | escape | default: collection.title | escape }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <span class="home-feature-spotlight__image-img home-feature-spotlight__image-img--placeholder"></span>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="home-feature-spotlight__badge">PICKUP</span>
          </span>
          <span class="home-feature-spotlight__body">
            <span class="home-feature-spotlight__title">{{ collection.title }}</span>
            {% if feature_desc != blank %}
              <span class="home-feature-spotlight__desc">{{ feature_desc }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="home-feature-spotlight__cta">
              特集を見る
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
            </span>
          </span>
        </a>
        {% assign shown = shown | plus: 1 %}
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endpaginate %}
  </div>
</div>

{% style %}
  .home-feature-spotlight {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-block: 32px;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__header {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    column-gap: 16px;
    row-gap: 4px;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__eyebrow {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__heading {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__more {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__image {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / var(--opacity-5, 0.05));
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__image-img,
  .home-feature-spotlight__image-img--placeholder {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    left: 10px;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 4px 10px;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-block-start: 14px;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-heading-bold--weight, 700);
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .home-feature-spotlight__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .home-feature-spotlight__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "注目ブランド特集（トップ）",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["index"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "英字ラベル",
      "default": "CURATED LABELS"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "見出し",
      "default": "おすすめ注目ブランド特集"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:settings.color_scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "注目ブランド特集（トップ）"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
